    <string name="privacy_policy">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_updated">Updated: 31 October 2026 · Version 5.1</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_intro">AyX Paste is built to respect your privacy completely. This policy explains exactly what the app does and does not do with your data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_title">No Personal Data Collected</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_1_body">AyX Paste does not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal information about you. There are no accounts, no sign-ins, no analytics, and no advertising trackers built into this app.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_title">No Access to Your Files</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_2_body">This app cannot read your device\'s folders, files, photos, contacts, or any other media. The Accessibility Service AyX Paste uses only observes text inside the specific input field you are actively typing in, purely to detect your saved shortcut commands. It never scans, browses, or accesses anything outside of that single active text field.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_title">100% Offline</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_3_body">AyX Paste works offline for commands. AI is optional: only when you type ..ai / ..ea / ..ra, or use AI Generator, only that text is sent to Groq (your own key, stored only on this device). Commands and replacement text stay in a local database on your device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_title">Why Accessibility Permission Is Needed</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_4_body">The Accessibility Service permission is the only permission this app requires. It is used solely to detect when you type one of your saved shortcut commands (like .upi) in any text field, and to replace it with your saved text. This permission does not let the app read content outside text fields, take screenshots, log your keystrokes elsewhere, or send any data off your device.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_5_title">Backups Stay With You</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_5_body">Export creates one plain JSON file named ayx.json, and Import reads ayx.json, at a location you choose. This data never leaves your device automatically — it is only shared if you personally choose to send the exported file somewhere yourself.</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_6_title">No Ads, No Tracking</string>
    <string name="privacy_section_6_body">AyX Paste contains no advertisements, no third-party SDKs, and no hidden trackers of any kind. What you build with this app stays on your device, under your control.</string>
